# Request mau cho REST Client; cung co the copy method/URL/body sang Postman.
# Khong tu dong gui. Du lieu mau; thay tai khoan/token/ID bang gia tri thuc te.
# Chay theo thu tu; cac thao tac doi mat khau/logout/delete de cuoi.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@base = {{host}}/api/v1
@teacherCode = REPLACE_TEACHER_CODE
@teacherPassword = REPLACE_TEACHER_PASSWORD
@teacherToken = REPLACE_TEACHER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@studentToken = REPLACE_STUDENT_ACCESS_TOKEN
@refreshToken = REPLACE_CURRENT_REFRESH_TOKEN
@studentId = 1
@examId = 1
@problemId = 1
@sessionId = 1

### 1. Health: 200 neu DB ket noi duoc
GET {{host}}/healthz

### 2. Login giao vien: 200. Copy access_token vao teacherToken
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"{{teacherCode}}","password":"{{teacherPassword}}"}

### 3. Tai khoan hien tai: 200
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 4. Tao SV rieng le: 201; 409 neu code da ton tai. Luu id tra ve
POST {{base}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"TESTSV006","fullname":"Đỗ Minh Khôi","date_of_birth":"20/11/2004"}

### 5. Import 5 SV: 200. Trong Postman dung form-data, key file, type File
POST {{base}}/students/import
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=StudentImportBoundary

--StudentImportBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="students-import.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv; charset=utf-8

< ./students-import.csv
--StudentImportBoundary--

### 6. Danh sach SV: 200
GET {{base}}/students?query=TESTSV&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 7. Tao de: 201. Copy id tu response vao examId
POST {{base}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Đề test API","description":"Dữ liệu thử cho luồng giáo viên và sinh viên"}

### 8. Danh sach de
GET {{base}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 9. Chi tiet de
GET {{base}}/exams/{{examId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 10. Tao problem: 201. Luu id vao problemId
POST {{base}}/exams/{{examId}}/problems
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"A","title":"Tổng hai số","statement":"Nhập hai số nguyên a, b. In tổng a + b. Ví dụ input: 2 3; output: 5.","time_limit_ms":1000,"memory_limit_mb":256}

### 11. Danh sach problem
GET {{base}}/exams/{{examId}}/problems
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 12. Chi tiet problem (giao vien)
GET {{base}}/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 13. Tao phien: 201. DOI GIO cho starts_at <= gio server hien tai < ends_at.
# Vi du duoi day mo ca ngay 22/10/2026, UTC+7; khong phai thoi luong mac dinh.
# Copy id tu response vao sessionId.
POST {{base}}/exams/{{examId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Phiên test API","starts_at":"2026-10-22T00:00:00+07:00","ends_at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00+07:00"}

### 14. Danh sach phien cua de
GET {{base}}/exams/{{examId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 15. Xem phien (giao vien)
GET {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 16. Login SV da import: 200. Copy access_token vao studentToken
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"TESTSV001","password":"TESTSV001"}

### 17. Cac phien SV nhin thay
GET {{base}}/me/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 18. Tham gia: 200 in_progress; 409 neu chua bat dau/da het gio
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 19. Xem phien (SV)
GET {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 20. Xem de (SV): 200 sau khi tham gia va toi gio bat dau
GET {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 21. Danh sach nguoi tham gia (GV)
GET {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 22. Dong bo test: can tao N.in/N.out trong data/problems/<problemId>/tests truoc.
# Hien chi scan test/tang version; requeueProblem la stub, KHONG cham that.
# Chua co file test: 409. Co cap hop le: 200.
POST {{base}}/problems/{{problemId}}/rejudge
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 23. Test da luu DB
GET {{base}}/problems/{{problemId}}/tests
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 24. Sua de: 200
PUT {{base}}/exams/{{examId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Đề test API đã sửa","description":"Kiểm tra cập nhật đề"}

### 25. Sua problem: 200. Giu limit nhu cu de khong tang version
PUT {{base}}/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"A","title":"Tổng hai số nguyên","statement":"Nhập a và b, in a + b.","time_limit_ms":1000,"memory_limit_mb":256}

### 26. Sua phien: 200. Dieu chinh ngay gio khi test
PUT {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Phiên test đã sửa","starts_at":"2026-10-22T00:00:00+07:00","ends_at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00+07:00"}

### 27. Ket thuc: 200 finished. Goi lai khong mo lai phien
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 28. Refresh: 200; token cu bi thay. Cap nhat ca access va refresh tu response
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### 29. Doi mat khau SV: 204. Thu sau cac buoc login mac dinh
PUT {{base}}/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"current_password":"TESTSV001","new_password":"TestPass2026!"}

### 30. Reset mat khau: 204. studentId PHAI la id cua SV muon reset
POST {{base}}/students/{{studentId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 31. Logout: 204. Dung refresh token hien hanh (dang xuat khong thu hoi JWT ngay)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### 32. Test phan quyen: SV goi route GV -> 403
GET {{base}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 33. Test thieu token -> 401
GET {{base}}/me

### 34. Xoa du lieu TEST: phien truoc (204 neu chua co submissions)
DELETE {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 35. Xoa problem TEST: 204 neu chua co submissions; file test van con tren host
DELETE {{base}}/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 36. Xoa de TEST: 204 khi da xoa het problem va phien
DELETE {{base}}/exams/{{examId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
